\subsection{Risk and value only partly overlap}

The key business insight of the EDA is that the customers most likely to leave are not the customers most worth keeping. Using the 75th percentiles of predicted risk (<< thresholds.risk | num(3) >>) and customer value (<< thresholds.value | usd >>), fitted on validation and frozen, the test customers fall into four segments (Table~\ref{tab:quad}, Figure~\ref{fig:riskvalue}).

